  name "a-constant-casting-a-list-the-reach-decides-no-answers-null"
  note "In claims Array<Int>: App.Tagged; Out (not reached) claims String: App.Tagged. A fold casts [\"x\", [\"s\"]] read as Any to Array<App.Tagged>: the second element is a list of text, which the reach already says is no App.Tagged."
  program {
    const {
      folded {
